    "chunk_text": "sunderspr\u00e6ce swi\u00f0e \u00deurh \u00f0as twa m\u00e6dena manega o\u00f0re becoman to Cristes geleafan, and to cl\u00e6nre drohtnunge. \u00d0urh Claudian becoman eac cl\u00e6ne wudewan mid godum wyllan to godes geleafan. And f\u00e6la cnihta on Crist gelyfden \u00feurh \u00f0a tw\u00e6gen halgan Protum et Iacinctum. Basilla h\u00e6fde enne h\u00e6\u00f0ene wogere, Pompeius gecyged, swi\u00f0e \u00e6\u00f0elboren, \u00feam geu\u00f0e se casere \u00fe\u00e6t \u00dea gesohte se cniht \u00fe\u00e6s kaseres fett, and \u00fea Romaniscan wytan mid woplicre ceorunge him mid Hw\u00e6t \u00fea se casere cw\u00e6\u00f0 him to andsware \u00fe\u00e6t Basilla sceolde gebugan to \u00f0am cnihte, o\u00fe\u00fee hi man And Eugenian he het his godum geoffrian, o\u00f0\u00f0e hi man mid wytum welreowlice acwealde. He het eac acw\u00e6llan ealle \u00fea cristenan, gif hi noldon bugan to \u00f0am bysmorfullum h\u00e6\u00f0enscype. \u00dea nolde Basilla brydguman geceosan n\u00e6nne butan Crist \u00fee heo gecoren h\u00e6fde, and wear\u00f0 \u00fea \u00c6fter \u00feysum wordum \u00fea tw\u00e6gen godes halgan, Protus and Iacinctus, wurdon sona gel\u00e6hte, and hi Hi wurdon \u00fea gel\u00e6dde to \u00fe\u00e6re la\u00f0an anlicnysse, ac heo tofeol sona to heora fotum formolsnod, swa \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe se dema \u00fe\u00e6t hi mid drycr\u00e6fte \u00fea anlicnyssa towurpon, and wear\u00f0 gebolgen. Het \u00fea beh\u00e6fdian \u00f0a halgan cy\u00f0eras, and hi swa ferdon mid sige to Criste. \u00d0",
